  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS 2024 &#x2013; WHO/GTFCC WASH Officer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By the end of 2024, more than 30 countries are experiencing cholera outbreaks. This dramatic number, which affects the poorest countries, is driven by intense climatic events and post-covid impacts where health systems have been strained. In response to this alarming situation, the World Health Organisation (WHO) has established an Incident Management Support Team (IMST) at global level to respond to this acute emergency.</narrative>
  </description>
